WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:05.430
I wish I had a whole pool full of water...

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:15.280
Hey, what's the matter?

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.250
Yahoo!

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.050
Dammit, not here too...

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.890
I'm alive again!

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.980
S- sorry...

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:26.270
What do you think you're doing!?

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:28.610
Feels great, doesn't it?

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:31.240
Quit it! Cut it out!!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.410
Damn...

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:42.260
You're the one who started it, you know.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:22.600
Dammit, you bastard!

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.530
Damn, those horns are in the way!

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:33.370
Marlene!

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.940
So close...

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:16.010
If you two are going to get it on, you'd better pick another place.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.920
If you value your lives, anyway.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.920
W- who're you?

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:25.190
Dice. I'm the only survivor of this place.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:44.550
Hey, sweetheart, how do things look? Huh?

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:49.210
The Blue appears to be hiding itself. Nothing to worry about.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:52.480
Unbelievable. Even drawing water means risking your life here.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.890
Okay, let's get going.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.220
Huh?

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:03.290
No, not "huh," pick it up!

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.510
Hold on tight!

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:19.880
Here goes...!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:35.530
There! I won't have to worry about water for some time now.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.190
M- my back...

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.860
You're hopeless. You won't be able to hold your woman either like that!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:48.210
H- hold her? You seem to be misunderstanding some things here.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.010
She's a fine woman, ain't she?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:55.880
Dice, wasn't it? Unit and Rank?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.210
Beats me...

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.880
What?

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:03.890
It was a long time ago. I've forgotten

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:08.550
We are currently under important orders, and are headed to Baikonur Base.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:14.570
You will provide us with a means of travel and show us a safe route immediately!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:15.900
Ay, young one!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.230
Huh?

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.900
What do they call you?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.910
Y- Yuji.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:26.240
Could you try starting the engine here for a bit, Yuji?

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.910
Me?

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:32.110
This here is my own special make, from odds and ends, see?

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.250
Lately it's been pretty high-strung.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.520
I've been taking extra good care of it and all.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:39.530
You can operate an Armor Shrike at least, can't you?

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:41.320
Y- yeah...

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.130
Ready?

00:08:55.280 --> 00:09:00.540
Hmph, I wonder if the coil's burned out.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:02.880
Are you listening to me!?

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:06.550
Marlene, back off! We are indebted to this man!

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.450
This is an order!

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:13.560
Not for me.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:14.890
What!?

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.230
Yuji, try it once again.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:21.500
If you're a soldier, then you should know what it means to disobey orders!

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.170
Yuji!!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.440
R- right.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:43.190
Ho! Attaway! Thank you, Yuji!

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:47.190
We don't have any time!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:51.860
You're welcome to this if you can use it, but unfortunately, it only seats one.

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:54.530
Isn't there any other means of travel!?

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.670
Well, I can't say there ain't.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:14.890
A- awesome...

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:21.890
Why, you... You think you aren't going to pay for this!?

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.830
Hell, has he come around again?

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:42.180
Sorry, but I need you to behave yourself for a while, little missy.

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:43.950
M- Marlene!

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.590
We'll pull out before it gets dark.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:54.530
After all, once night falls, things get out of control.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.530
Start driving, already!

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:58.730
R- right...

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.260
Don't worry, she'll wake up sometime in the morning.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:08.730
Y- yeah...

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:32.550
So anyway, are you really a Sleeper?

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:33.890
Yeah.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:37.900
First time I've ever seen one of you alive and moving around!

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:42.560
For my part, I'm not in this world because I wanted to be.

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:50.910
Sure must have been a disaster for you, waking up to times such as these.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:53.910
No, I'm still underage and all...

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:57.780
Well, us meeting like this was somehow destined to be.

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:04.320
Let's be friends, okay?

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:17.960
You know, that was a shame back there.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:22.270
You haven't done it yet, right?

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.280
W- what are you talking about!?

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.940
You're sweet on her, ain't you?

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:28.280
Y- you don't mean...!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.890
In that case, don't you die!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.490
Not until you've held her, that is.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:55.240
But you know, I don't much care for soldiers.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.900
How about it, Yuji?

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:02.250
Why don't you stay here and take it easy for a while?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.250
But, I...

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.580
You have to go, do you?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:11.250
I've already come all this way and everything...

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:16.260
I gotcha. But I can't guide you.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:19.600
I'm hated by military guys, see?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.260
Why is it you're here by yourself?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:27.140
There's still something left for me to do.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.220
Huh?

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.310
Marlene?

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.230
Dice-san...

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:57.570
Unbelievable! What a troublesome little missy!

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:04.910
Don't tell me she's thinking of going to Baikonur by Armor Shrike!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:10.250
Dumbass, if she went in that jalopy, she'd break down along the way!

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.250
So what the hell do we do?

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:14.690
Hold on, don't tell me...!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.540
The supply depot's warehouse?

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.180
Yeah! There's still some dust-covered treasure in there,

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.880
from Armor Shrikes to Buggies.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.890
Then why do you use a rickety heap like that?

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:54.220
Watch that "rickety heap" talk!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:59.230
But yeah, that place also happens to be the place that thing likes most!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:30.700
Okay!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:43.540
To think this would break down so soon. This thing's had it.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:47.210
Wait Yuji! Not until I've fixed this!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.870
But, Marlene...!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:53.320
It's no use! We're no match for that thing without an Armor Shrike!

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.520
Come on, Yuji!

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:42.530
Marlene!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:43.540
Yuji!

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:44.540
Hang on!

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:46.840
Idiot! Stay back!

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.260
Listen to me, Yuji!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:11.560
In the right corner, there's a Buggy that still runs!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:13.900
You take that and get out of here!

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:14.940
What about you, Marlene!?

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:20.570
I will be a decoy!

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:25.240
No way, Marlene!

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:26.210
Go!

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.520
Yuji!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:41.190
Marlene!

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.630
We're going together!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.170
You idiot!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.030
Eh?

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:02.810
This time, at least, I'm not letting you get your way!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:17.560
Yuji! The back of its head!

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:20.570
Shoot the core now!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:21.570
B- but...

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.860
Do it!!

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:34.780
Yuji!!

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:51.060
I'm not letting you go!

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:31.730
Now, everything has ended.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.500
Dice-san...

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:41.840
I was unable to protect the thing most important to me.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.510
Huh?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.450
Well, let's go.

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:07.470
So long...

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:39.690
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:45.820
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:54.970
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.090 --> 00:22:01.140
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:07.560
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:14.750
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.940 --> 00:22:19.910
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.010 --> 00:22:25.970
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.270 --> 00:22:32.250
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:39.730
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.910 --> 00:22:46.590
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:57.350
It is my duty to bring the Sample to Baikonur.

00:22:57.420 --> 00:23:02.690
I have become separated from that Sample, which interferes with my duty.

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:07.690
And so, I am worried all over. Is there anything more important?

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:12.030
Right now, there's nothing more important to me than my duty.

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:13.530
No reason there should be...
